      "text": "(\n    <div style={{ backgroundColor: 'var(--color-background)', boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', fontSize: '12px', fontSynthesis: 'none', gap: '40px', height: 'fit-content', lineHeight: '16px', MozOsxFontSmoothing: 'grayscale', overflow: 'clip', overflowWrap: 'anywhere', padding: '48px', WebkitFontSmoothing: 'antialiased', width: '1800px' }}>\n      <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: '8px' }}>\n        <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--color-foreground)', fontFamily: '\"Inter\", system-ui, sans-serif', fontSize: '30px', fontWeight: 600, letterSpacing: '-0.025em', lineHeight: '36px' }}>\n          Streak\n        </div>\n        <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--color-muted-foreground)', fontFamily: '\"Inter\", system-ui, sans-serif', fontSize: '16px', lineHeight: '24px', whiteSpace: 'pre-wrap', width: '900px' }}>\n          Under review. How many days in a row a person has done enough. Four forms of the same thing.<br />Compact: a flame and the number, with the week beside it. Used at the top of a song's sheet (Screens/Songs/YourSongs).<br />Completion: the flame large, the number, \"day streak\", and the week under it. Its own screen after an activity's result (Parts/Rewards/ActivityResult).<br />Week strip: seven marks, Monday to Sunday, filled for days that counted. Today is outlined until it counts.<br />Leaderboard: rank, profile and current streak, with the viewer's own place as the last row. One list serves a song and a community, and it has its own page, drawn in the last group.<br />Where each leaderboard opens from, approved by the workspace_owner on 2026-10-12: on a song, a Leaderboard action on a line under the song streak; on a community, a line above the feed with the viewer's community streak and a Leaderboard action. Both are drawn here and in place on their own sheets.<br />One streak for every activity, per the workspace_owner on 2026-10-12: Study, Karaoke and Dance all feed the same streak. The completion screen follows Study and Karaoke; both flows draw it on the phone. Dance has no completion screen, because its result comes later. Not built: the server's streak writer takes Study and Karaoke only, and Dance is reserved and not wired.<br />Two facts that must stay apart. \"Qualified today\" says the day already counts, whenever that happened. \"This completion newly earned today\" says the activity just finished is the one that made it count. The compact form and the week strip follow the first. The completion screen follows only the second: a person who qualified this morning and finishes another activity tonight sees the result and no streak screen. Do not light today because an activity ended.<br />Accepted by the workspace_owner on 2026-10-12, loosely (\"sound reasonable\"): an attempt that finishes below the target does not count, as today, so no streak screen follows one. A dance counts for the day it was sent, once it passes: a waiting take earns nothing yet, and passing fills in the original day.<br />Scope: the server stores two streaks, one per song and one per community, both kept against the account, and has a leaderboard for each (top 100 by current streak, plus the viewer's own place). The workspace_owner wants both levels working, as a ranking inside a community. The app calls neither leaderboard. They are separate from the Karaoke score leaderboard the app already has.<br />Missing support, kept apart from the design. The app's current Study screen does not hand the display any streak fields; the older Study display had the count and qualified-today. The contracts read in this pass do not carry seven daily marks, so the week strip has no data behind it. Nothing read reports \"newly earned\" as its own field.<br />Instances looked at: the compact and completion forms below, copied from their sheets. Not rechecked: Flows/Studying/Session and Flows/Karaoke/Practice. Not drawn: either leaderboard entry on desktop, the leaderboard page on desktop, and its empty, loading and failed states.\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style={{ alignItems: 'start', boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', flexWrap: 'wrap', gap: '48px' }}>\n        <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', flexShrink: '0', gap: '16px', width: '390px' }}>\n          <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--color-muted-foreground)', fontFamily: '\"Inter\", system-ui, sans-serif', fontSize: '16px', fontWeight: 500, letterSpacing: '0.03em', lineHeight: '20px', textTransform: 'uppercase' }}>\n            Compact, with the week\n          </div>\n          <div style={{ alignItems: 'center', boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingTop: '20px' }}>\n            <div style={{ alignItems: 'center', boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', gap: '6px' }}>\n              <svg width=\"36\" height=\"36\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style={{ flexShrink: '0', display: 'inline-block' }}>\n                <path d=\"M143.38,17.85a8,8,0,0,0-12.63,3.41l-22,60.41L84.59,58.26a8,8,0,0,0-11.93.89C51,87.53,40,116.08,40,144a88,88,0,0,0,176,0C216,84.55,165.21,36,143.38,17.85Zm40.51,135.49a57.6,57.6,0,0,1-46.56,46.55A7.65,7.65,0,0,1,136,200a8,8,0,0,1-1.32-15.89c16.57-2.79,30.63-16.85,33.44-33.45a8,8,0,0,1,15.78,2.68Z\" fill=\"var(--color-warning)\" />\n              </svg>\n              <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--color-warning)', fontFamily: '\"Inter\", system-ui, sans-serif', fontSize: '36px', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: '40px' }}>\n                12\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', gap: '6px' }}>\n              <div style={{ alignItems: 'center', boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', flexShrink: '0', gap: '4px',